{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b&quot;Wonderful Richman&quot; is an online multiplayer board game with elements of strategy and leisure. Players take turns rolling dice to move, purchase properties, upgrade buildings, use magic cards, utilize Paco's enhancements, and leverage the three unique skills of their animals to earn money, accumulate assets, and ultimately defeat their opponents.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/c6550ea21182671bc88d608f47fca0ac.avif?t=1765422339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras_big/c6550ea21182671bc88d608f47fca0ac.avif?t=1765422339 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paco System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 8 rounds in the game, players are given a random chance to choose one out of three to strengthen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/96fbaa4b622102953f1ff1dc695f6964.avif?t=1765422339\" width=1600 height=902 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each little animal has its own exclusive skill. There are three types of skills: active skills, income skills, and passive skills. Players can formulate their own playstyles by combining the skill characteristics of each little animal with Paco and magic cards.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/7e3356085d553541f869a7ebbe7c2dff.avif?t=1765422339\" width=625 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building - level Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building - level gameplay is a new mode designed for construction and upgrading in Wonderful Richman. Players can carry out construction and upgrading on a single plot up to six times. There are over 50 building floors for players to choose from, and they can match the floor effects according to the in - game situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/132af99a2a9443623ea7019526259150.poster.avif?t=1765422339\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/132af99a2a9443623ea7019526259150.webm?t=1765422339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/132af99a2a9443623ea7019526259150.mp4?t=1765422339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranking Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bCustom Mode</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2771380?t=1765422339","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/b46257c8ebd34f3ccd9edc208b7bbfedece8f281/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765422339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/bbd7f8a2a9023c55f45b1966422a36cfd7649b90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765422339","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/bbd7f8a2a9023c55f45b1966422a36cfd7649b90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765422339","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>About Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/272ff0012292683be9855bcf23e982cd.avif?t=1765422339\" width=545 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players' QQ Group: 763014654</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, everyone! Come and try our game! If you've got any ideas or suggestions about our game, just tell us in the group. We're famous for listening to what you say!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come on, let's make Wonderful Richman a lot more fun together!</p></p><br><h1>Update plan</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/1f97bddaba16f4a6d2fc63605a0ded5c.avif?t=1765422339\" width=700 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b&quot;Wonderful Richman&quot; is an online multiplayer board game with elements of strategy and leisure. Players take turns rolling dice to move, purchase properties, upgrade buildings, use magic cards, utilize Paco's enhancements, and leverage the three unique skills of their animals to earn money, accumulate assets, and ultimately defeat their opponents.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/c6550ea21182671bc88d608f47fca0ac.avif?t=1765422339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras_big/c6550ea21182671bc88d608f47fca0ac.avif?t=1765422339 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paco System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 8 rounds in the game, players are given a random chance to choose one out of three to strengthen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/96fbaa4b622102953f1ff1dc695f6964.avif?t=1765422339\" width=1600 height=902 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each little animal has its own exclusive skill. There are three types of skills: active skills, income skills, and passive skills. Players can formulate their own playstyles by combining the skill characteristics of each little animal with Paco and magic cards.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/7e3356085d553541f869a7ebbe7c2dff.avif?t=1765422339\" width=625 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building - level Gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building - level gameplay is a new mode designed for construction and upgrading in Wonderful Richman. Players can carry out construction and upgrading on a single plot up to six times. There are over 50 building floors for players to choose from, and they can match the floor effects according to the in - game situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/132af99a2a9443623ea7019526259150.poster.avif?t=1765422339\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/132af99a2a9443623ea7019526259150.webm?t=1765422339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/extras/132af99a2a9443623ea7019526259150.mp4?t=1765422339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranking Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200bCustom Mode</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u6d77\u68e0\u679c\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771380/8d5e66afd718fbc631a34b42b8749d7829e17283/header.jpg?t=1765422339","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2771380/291876049/94816c1ab8370c860d517b7030208a812138bc40/1750898552/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747967403","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2771380/291876049/94816c1ab8370c860d517b7030208a812138bc40/1750898552/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747967403","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2771380/291876049/94816c1ab8370c860d517b7030208a812138bc40/1750898552/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747967403","id":257143969,"name":"\u5947\u5999\u5927\u5bcc\u7fc1\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143969/aa74f7e294f7c7659411fed2fc260428d586949c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747967403"}],"name":"\u5947\u5999\u592